Description: add HTTP/2 support to xymonnet HTTP tests
 Add optional nghttp2 integration, automatic h2 negotiation for HTTPS,
 required HTTP/2 schemes, cleartext HTTP/2 prior knowledge, and hardened
 stream and nonblocking I/O handling.
Author: soundgoof <soundgoof@gmail.com>
Origin: https://github.com/axians/xymon/compare/3a075231e4c69b965edc8689f1450e4028fbd6da...068f1ad2cadba3e2db003b8a889ba4c4a8588704
